动的人才是一样的", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "8", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAMIpwTWH9FPyaq4jHit4mzFYTgPAa8v1l9VRnlkqkgoU", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAMIpwTWH9FPyaq4jHit4mzFYTgPAa8v1l9VRnlkqkgoU", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "dyf8jro3s4al", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "风华正茂", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_d193c72cd51840f9a21839cee8788aaa.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794419805429}, {"comment_id": "7676357477495767827", "create_time": 1787291254, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7676308909367266612", "content": "把千年前的“木与丝的算法”送上天，让云锦的经纬与星河共振。古人用绳结写“0和1”，我们用卫星寄“时光信笺”——这不是对抗遗忘，是把“前程似锦”织进宇宙的浪漫。大花楼织机高四米、长六米，装不下的是中国人刻在榫卯里的巧思与仰望星空的执着。从龙袍到星河，不变的是把想象变成现实的勇气。愿每一次提花，都能在星河里开出一朵永不褪色的云锦。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "4", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAZHUQkvkdBZPtmKr0pKpoOCsotI3wkDyX7x1_JaYdvrE", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAZHUQkvkdBZPtmKr0pKpoOCsotI3wkDyX7x1_JaYdvrE", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "336068541", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "晨晨呀！", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_e6ab9fb785a644eb431b90eb07fce903.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794419805429}, {"comment_id": "7677475094839378746", "create_time": 1787551469, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7676308909367266612", "content": "上学时有木雕课，一开始也用结实的实木，结果发现根本就糟不动，后面用成复合板了", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "14", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAfirngklEOk-URCtUzw9WRZBUDpZ-0L8N0xEKioit9C8", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAfirngklEOk-URCtUzw9WRZBUDpZ-0L8N0xEKioit9C8", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "1278966712", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "是蒙蒙吖", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x